# strava.targets  -- file-authoritative target list (Option A)
# Strava: 'me' = authenticated athlete; 'feed' = the For You / following activity
# feed. The following/followers roster + activity spider (everyone with media or
# map data, famous or not -- NO famous filter for strava per Bryan) is driven by
# STRAVA_FOLLOW_SPIDER in strava.env, not by target lines.
# Format:  target_id | Display Name | priority
# Edit + restart to apply.

me | Self | 10
feed | For You / Following Feed | 8
